1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:07,976
All those Shopee orders? Let’s turn them into a spreadsheet! Here’s how to get started with Trako Order Exporter.

2
00:00:08,533 --> 00:00:14,056
First up: install Trako in Chrome, sign in to Shopee, and open My Purchases

3
00:00:14,056 --> 00:00:16,339
Look for the little Trako panel

4
00:00:16,339 --> 00:00:18,253
That’s where you’ll start!

5
00:00:18,825 --> 00:00:23,618
Want more orders in your export? Scroll down to load them first

6
00:00:23,618 --> 00:00:25,672
Tap Load More if it appears

7
00:00:25,672 --> 00:00:30,009
Remember: Trako scans what’s already loaded on this page.

8
00:00:30,575 --> 00:00:37,708
Ready? Click Export orders to CSV! Trako checks your loaded orders for completed purchases

9
00:00:37,708 --> 00:00:40,799
Orders with other statuses are skipped.

10
00:00:41,367 --> 00:00:46,234
Watch the progress right here, along with the estimated time left

11
00:00:46,234 --> 00:00:50,802
You might see temporary order tabs while Trako checks details

12
00:00:50,802 --> 00:00:53,199
Need to stop? Hit Cancel export.

13
00:00:53,783 --> 00:00:59,009
Something got skipped? Check the product name and the reason underneath

14
00:00:59,009 --> 00:01:02,689
An order still marked To Receive won’t be included

15
00:01:02,689 --> 00:01:05,265
Want a fresh scan? Click Scan again

16
00:01:05,265 --> 00:01:08,135
Load more orders first to include more!

17
00:01:08,700 --> 00:01:14,041
When your file is ready, choose a folder, give it a name, and click Save

18
00:01:14,041 --> 00:01:15,228
Nice and simple!

19
00:01:15,783 --> 00:01:18,880
Now open the CSV in your spreadsheet app

20
00:01:18,880 --> 00:01:21,048
Each product has its own row

21
00:01:21,048 --> 00:01:28,479
Seeing hash marks? Widen the column! Some fields may stay blank if the details aren’t available.

22
00:01:29,033 --> 00:01:34,333
And you’re done! Load your orders, scan with Trako, and save your CSV

23
00:01:34,333 --> 00:01:39,632
Your order data stays in your browser and isn’t sent to Trako servers

24
00:01:39,632 --> 00:01:40,937
Happy organizing!

